  "id": "the-naked-director-s01e06-scene-08",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "勝てる方法が一つある  (One Way to Win)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "furuya": "古谷",
    "toshi": "トシ"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back in Tokyo, Toshi visits yakuza boss Furuya to talk about Muranishi's wild overseas production and asks for Furuya's backing against rival executive Ikezawa. Let's listen in Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "ありがとうございます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "ハワイ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "はい、ハリウッド作品みたいのを撮りに行ってます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "どんな作品になるのか、まったく想像できねえな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "おっさんが考えてることは誰にも読めないんで。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "で、相談ってのは何だ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "あいつら黙らせてほしいんですよ、古谷さんの力で。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "ヤクザにそういうことを頼むのはどういうことか、分かってるよな、トシ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "分かってます。でも俺らは安心して商売できないんですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "お前らが池沢とのケンカに勝てる方法が一つある。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "ホントですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "ああ。リスクもあるが、懸けてみるか、トシ。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "ありがとうございます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you very much.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "ハワイ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hawaii?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "はい、ハリウッド作品みたいのを撮りに行ってます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, they've gone to shoot something like a Hollywood movie.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "どんな作品になるのか、まったく想像できねえな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I can't even begin to imagine what kind of film that'll turn out to be.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "おっさんが考えてることは誰にも読めないんで。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Nobody can ever read what that guy is thinking.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "で、相談ってのは何だ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So, what was it you wanted to consult me about?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "あいつら黙らせてほしいんですよ、古谷さんの力で。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I want you to shut those guys up with your influence, Mr. Furuya.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "ヤクザにそういうことを頼むのはどういうことか、分かってるよな、トシ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You understand what it means to ask a yakuza for a favor like that, right, Toshi?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "分かってます。でも俺らは安心して商売できないんですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I understand. Otherwise we can't do business with peace of mind.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "お前らが池沢とのケンカに勝てる方法が一つある。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There is one way you guys can win your fight against Ikezawa.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "ホントですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Really?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "ああ。リスクもあるが、懸けてみるか、トシ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yeah. There's risk involved too, though—ready to take the gamble, Toshi?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
